  ;; the reason to depend on them rather than keep the hand-rolled
  ;; `java.net.http` calls this app had: those could only ever be exercised
  ;; against a live account, so they were never exercised.
  ;;
  ;; `org-ietf-imap` and `org-ietf-smtp` are additions, not replacements —
  ;; before them this app could not read a mailbox that was not Google or
  ;; Microsoft, and could not send mail at all.
