  ;; fixture replaced a developer's identity state and broke Passkey
  ;; registration. The property beats the environment variable on purpose, so
  ;; an exported CLOUD_ITONAMI_DATA_DIR cannot redirect the suite back onto a
  ;; real store.
  ;; Regenerate the shipped decision-core KIR. Combine with :test, which
  ;; carries the compiler; a later alias's :main-opts wins:
